					<![CDATA[
						 <p>My thoughts exactly. This is the only pop culture SCP that doesn't make me instantly downvote. I think it helps that it's spoofing MTF procedures as well as spoofing Scooby-Doo. Most failed pop culture -Js just rely on the love/hate people have for the target, but this one goes farther than that.</p> <p>Besides, &quot;Rooby rooby [REDACTED] - Agent Mu 4-5&quot; is absolutely hilarious.</p> <p>A rare pop culture +1 from me.</p> 
				 	]]>
