				<wikidot:authorName>Sophia Light</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>306685</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Ah, the thing they're referencing is <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-382196/">here</a>, and it's an argument about the use of the term &quot;neutral vote&quot;, not the position of being neutral or just not voting on an article. Just so you don't get too confused.</p> 
